# Handoff load (once per conversation)

**Run at most once per conversation.** If you already read a handoff in this
chat, do not read or brief again unless the user asks (`/handoff-load`, 「引き継ぎ」).

## When (first substantial turn only)

At conversation start, before substantial project work (edits, multi-step plans,
training advice):

1. Skip if the user says this is an unrelated new topic.
2. Read `.cursor/handoff/HANDOFF.md` if non-empty.
3. Else newest `*_handoff.md`: `docs/user/` → `docs/auto/` → `docs/version/`.
4. Brief in 3 lines: Goal / Status / Next. No full paste.
5. Follow Decisions; do not overturn without asking.

Detailed procedure: `handoff-load` skill. Saving: `handoff-save` skill only.
